i > 0 verified numerically (holds for t << 1/|lam|^(3/2))\n# - Condition 2: lam*psi = |lam|*(ln(1+t)+sqrt(x+1)) -> +inf as x->inf\n\npsi = -sp.ln(1 + t) - sp.sqrt(x + 1)\n\nsubs_dict = {\n    alpha : 1,\n    s     : -1,\n    lam   : sp.Rational(-1, 10),\n}\n","numLines":21,"startLine":1,"totalLines":21}}}
